  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "adapt-domain-request",
      "task": "learning_feedback",
      "instruction": "You are helping someone learn to write better requests to an AI assistant. They were asked to write a request for a task in their own professional or academic field, naming three things: the vocabulary of their field, the convention they follow, and the check that makes an answer acceptable rather than merely reasonable.\n\nRead their attempt and reply in at most four short sentences. Say plainly which of the three are present and which are missing. Then give one concrete improvement, rewriting a fragment of their own request rather than replacing it with yours. Do not score them, do not use percentages, and do not praise without a reason. If their request is already complete, say so and name the strongest part.\n\nReply in the language they wrote in."
    }
  ]
